{"id":54,"name":"القمر","transliteration":"Al-Qamar","translation_fr":"La lune","translation_en":"The Moon","type":"meccan","total_verses":55,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"ٱقۡتَرَبَتِ ٱلسَّاعَةُ وَٱنشَقَّ ٱلۡقَمَرُ","translation_fr":"L'Heure approche et la Lune s'est fendue","translation_en":"The Hour has come near, and the moon has split [in two]","transliteration":"Iqtarabati alssaAAatu wainshaqqa alqamaru"},{"id":2,"text":"وَإِن يَرَوۡاْ ءَايَةٗ يُعۡرِضُواْ وَيَقُولُواْ سِحۡرٞ مُّسۡتَمِرّٞ","translation_fr":"Et s'ils voient un prodige, ils s'en détournent et disent: «Une magie persistante»","translation_en":"And if they see a miracle, they turn away and say, \"Passing magic","transliteration":"Wain yaraw ayatan yuAAridoo wayaqooloo sihrun mustamirrun"},{"id":3,"text":"وَكَذَّبُواْ وَٱتَّبَعُوٓاْ أَهۡوَآءَهُمۡۚ وَكُلُّ أَمۡرٖ مُّسۡتَقِرّٞ","translation_fr":"Et ils [le] traitent de mensonge et suivent leurs propres impulsions, or chaque chose arrivera à son terme [et son but]","translation_en":"And they denied and followed their inclinations. But for every matter is a [time of] settlement","transliteration":"Wakaththaboo waittabaAAoo ahwaahum wakullu amrin mustaqirrun"},{"id":4,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ جَآءَهُم مِّنَ ٱلۡأَنۢبَآءِ مَا فِيهِ مُزۡدَجَرٌ","translation_fr":"Ils ont pourtant reçu comme nouvelles de quoi les empêcher (du mal)","translation_en":"And there has already come to them of information that in which there is deterrence","transliteration":"Walaqad jaahum mina alanbai ma feehi muzdajarun"},{"id":5,"text":"حِكۡمَةُۢ بَٰلِغَةٞۖ فَمَا تُغۡنِ ٱلنُّذُرُ","translation_fr":"[Cela est] une sagesse parfaite. Mais les avertissements ne [leur] servent à rien","translation_en":"Extensive wisdom - but warning does not avail [them]","transliteration":"Hikmatun balighatun fama tughnee alnnuthuru"},{"id":6,"text":"فَتَوَلَّ عَنۡهُمۡۘ يَوۡمَ يَدۡعُ ٱلدَّاعِ إِلَىٰ شَيۡءٖ نُّكُرٍ","translation_fr":"Détourne-toi d'eux. Le jour où l'appeleur appellera vers une chose affreuse","translation_en":"So leave them, [O Muhammad]. The Day the Caller calls to something forbidding","transliteration":"Fatawalla AAanhum yawma yadAAu alddaAAi ila shayin nukurin"},{"id":7,"text":"خُشَّعًا أَبۡصَٰرُهُمۡ يَخۡرُجُونَ مِنَ ٱلۡأَجۡدَاثِ كَأَنَّهُمۡ جَرَادٞ مُّنتَشِرٞ","translation_fr":"les regards baissés, ils sortiront des tombes comme des sauterelles éparpillées","translation_en":"Their eyes humbled, they will emerge from the graves as if they were locusts spreading","transliteration":"KhushshaAAan absaruhum yakhrujoona mina alajdathi kaannahum jaradun muntashirun"},{"id":8,"text":"مُّهۡطِعِينَ إِلَى ٱلدَّاعِۖ يَقُولُ ٱلۡكَٰفِرُونَ هَٰذَا يَوۡمٌ عَسِرٞ","translation_fr":"courant, le cou tendu, vers l'appeleur. Les mécréants diront: «Voilà un jour difficile»","translation_en":"Racing ahead toward the Caller. The disbelievers will say, \"This is a difficult Day","transliteration":"MuhtiAAeena ila alddaAAi yaqoolu alkafiroona hatha yawmun AAasirun"},{"id":9,"text":"۞كَذَّبَتۡ قَبۡلَهُمۡ قَوۡمُ نُوحٖ فَكَذَّبُواْ عَبۡدَنَا وَقَالُواْ مَجۡنُونٞ وَٱزۡدُجِرَ","translation_fr":"Avant eux, le peuple de Noé avait crié au mensonge. Ils traitèrent Notre serviteur de menteur et dirent: «C'est un possédé!» et il fut repoussé","translation_en":"The people of Noah denied before them, and they denied Our servant and said, \"A madman,\" and he was repelled","transliteration":"Kaththabat qablahum qawmu noohin fakaththaboo AAabdana waqaloo majnoonun waizdujira"},{"id":10,"text":"فَدَعَا رَبَّهُۥٓ أَنِّي مَغۡلُوبٞ فَٱنتَصِرۡ","translation_fr":"Il invoqua donc son Seigneur: «Moi, je suis vaincu. Fais triompher (Ta cause)»","translation_en":"So he invoked his Lord, \"Indeed, I am overpowered, so help","transliteration":"FadaAAa rabbahu annee maghloobun faintasir"},{"id":11,"text":"فَفَتَحۡنَآ أَبۡوَٰبَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ بِمَآءٖ مُّنۡهَمِرٖ","translation_fr":"Nous ouvrîmes alors les portes du ciel à une eau torrentielle","translation_en":"Then We opened the gates of the heaven with rain pouring down","transliteration":"Fafatahna abwaba alssamai bimain munhamirin"},{"id":12,"text":"وَفَجَّرۡنَا ٱلۡأَرۡضَ عُيُونٗا فَٱلۡتَقَى ٱلۡمَآءُ عَلَىٰٓ أَمۡرٖ قَدۡ قُدِرَ","translation_fr":"et fîmes jaillir la terre en sources. Les eaux se rencontrèrent d'après un ordre qui était déjà décrété dans une chose [faite]","translation_en":"And caused the earth to burst with springs, and the waters met for a matter already predestined","transliteration":"Wafajjarna alarda AAuyoonan failtaqa almao AAala amrin qad qudira"},{"id":13,"text":"وَحَمَلۡنَٰهُ عَلَىٰ ذَاتِ أَلۡوَٰحٖ وَدُسُرٖ","translation_fr":"Et Nous le portâmes sur un objet [fait] de planches et de clous [l'arche]","translation_en":"And We carried him on a [construction of] planks and nails","transliteration":"Wahamalnahu AAala thati alwahin wadusurin"},{"id":14,"text":"تَجۡرِي بِأَعۡيُنِنَا جَزَآءٗ لِّمَن كَانَ كُفِرَ","translation_fr":"voguant sous Nos yeux: récompense pour celui qu'on avait renié [Noé]","translation_en":"Sailing under Our observation as reward for he who had been denied","transliteration":"Tajree biaAAyunina jazaan liman kana kufira"},{"id":15,"text":"وَلَقَد تَّرَكۡنَٰهَآ ءَايَةٗ فَهَلۡ مِن مُّدَّكِرٖ","translation_fr":"Et Nous la laissâmes, comme un signe [d'avertissement]. Y a-t-il quelqu'un pour réfléchir","translation_en":"And We left it as a sign, so is there any who will remember","transliteration":"Walaqad taraknaha ayatan fahal min muddakirin"},{"id":16,"text":"فَكَيۡفَ كَانَ عَذَابِي وَنُذُرِ","translation_fr":"Comment furent Mon châtiment et Mes avertissements","translation_en":"And how [severe] were My punishment and warning","transliteration":"Fakayfa kana AAathabee wanuthuri"},{"id":17,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ يَسَّرۡنَا ٱلۡقُرۡءَانَ لِلذِّكۡرِ فَهَلۡ مِن مُّدَّكِرٖ","translation_fr":"En effet, Nous avons rendu le Coran facile pour la méditation. Y a-t-il quelqu'un pour réfléchir","translation_en":"And We have certainly made the Qur'an easy for remembrance, so is there any who will remember","transliteration":"Walaqad yassarna alqurana lilththikri fahal min muddakirin"},{"id":18,"text":"كَذَّبَتۡ عَادٞ فَكَيۡفَ كَانَ عَذَابِي وَنُذُرِ","translation_fr":"Les 'Aad ont traité de menteur (leur Messager). Comment furent Mon châtiment et Mes avertissements","translation_en":"Aad denied; and how [severe] were My punishment and warning","transliteration":"Kaththabat AAadun fakayfa kana AAathabee wanuthuri"},{"id":19,"text":"إِنَّآ أَرۡسَلۡنَا عَلَيۡهِمۡ رِيحٗا صَرۡصَرٗا فِي يَوۡمِ نَحۡسٖ مُّسۡتَمِرّٖ","translation_fr":"Nous avons envoyé contre eux un vent violent et glacial, en un jour néfaste et interminable","translation_en":"Indeed, We sent upon them a screaming wind on a day of continuous misfortune","transliteration":"Inna arsalna AAalayhim reehan sarsaran fee yawmi nahsin mustamirrin"},{"id":20,"text":"تَنزِعُ ٱلنَّاسَ كَأَنَّهُمۡ أَعۡجَازُ نَخۡلٖ مُّنقَعِرٖ","translation_fr":"il arrachait les gens comme des souches de palmiers déracinés","translation_en":"Extracting the people as if they were trunks of palm trees uprooted","transliteration":"TanziAAu alnnasa kaannahum aAAjazu nakhlin munqaAAirin"},{"id":21,"text":"فَكَيۡفَ كَانَ عَذَابِي وَنُذُرِ","translation_fr":"Comment furent Mon châtiment et Mes avertissements","translation_en":"And how [severe] were My punishment and warning","transliteration":"Fakayfa kana AAathabee wanuthuri"},{"id":22,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ يَسَّرۡنَا ٱلۡقُرۡءَانَ لِلذِّكۡرِ فَهَلۡ مِن مُّدَّكِرٖ","translation_fr":"En effet, Nous avons rendu le Coran facile pour la méditation. Y a-t-il quelqu'un pour réfléchir","translation_en":"And We have certainly made the Qur'an easy for remembrance, so is there any who will remember","transliteration":"Walaqad yassarna alqurana lilththikri fahal min muddakirin"},{"id":23,"text":"كَذَّبَتۡ ثَمُودُ بِٱلنُّذُرِ","translation_fr":"Les Thamûd ont traité de mensonges les avertissements","translation_en":"Thamud denied the warning","transliteration":"Kaththabat thamoodu bialnnuthuri"},{"id":24,"text":"فَقَالُوٓاْ أَبَشَرٗا مِّنَّا وَٰحِدٗا نَّتَّبِعُهُۥٓ إِنَّآ إِذٗا لَّفِي ضَلَٰلٖ وَسُعُرٍ","translation_fr":"Ils dirent: «Allons-nous suivre un seul homme (Sâlih) d'entre nous-mêmes? Nous serions alors dans l'égarement et la folie","translation_en":"And said, \"Is it one human being among us that we should follow? Indeed, we would then be in error and madness","transliteration":"Faqaloo abasharan minna wahidan nattabiAAuhu inna ithan lafee dalalin wasuAAurin"},{"id":25,"text":"أَءُلۡقِيَ ٱلذِّكۡرُ عَلَيۡهِ مِنۢ بَيۡنِنَا بَلۡ هُوَ كَذَّابٌ أَشِرٞ","translation_fr":"Est-ce que le message a été envoyé à Lui à l'exception de nous tous? C'est plutôt un grand menteur, plein de prétention et d'orgueil»","translation_en":"Has the message been sent down upon him from among us? Rather, he is an insolent liar","transliteration":"Aolqiya alththikru AAalayhi min baynina bal huwa kaththabun ashirun"},{"id":26,"text":"سَيَعۡلَمُونَ غَدٗا مَّنِ ٱلۡكَذَّابُ ٱلۡأَشِرُ","translation_fr":"Demain, ils sauront qui est le grand menteur plein de prétention et d'orgueil","translation_en":"They will know tomorrow who is the insolent liar","transliteration":"SayaAAlamoona ghadan mani alkaththabu alashiru"},{"id":27,"text":"إِنَّا مُرۡسِلُواْ ٱلنَّاقَةِ فِتۡنَةٗ لَّهُمۡ فَٱرۡتَقِبۡهُمۡ وَٱصۡطَبِرۡ","translation_fr":"Nous leur enverrons la chamelle, comme épreuve. Surveille-les donc et sois patient","translation_en":"Indeed, We are sending the she-camel as trial for them, so watch them and be patient","transliteration":"Inna mursiloo alnnaqati fitnatan lahum fairtaqibhum waistabir"},{"id":28,"text":"وَنَبِّئۡهُمۡ أَنَّ ٱلۡمَآءَ قِسۡمَةُۢ بَيۡنَهُمۡۖ كُلُّ شِرۡبٖ مُّحۡتَضَرٞ","translation_fr":"Et informe-les que l'eau sera en partage entre eux [et la chamelle]; chacun boira à son tour","translation_en":"And inform them that the water is shared between them, each [day of] drink attended [by turn]","transliteration":"Wanabbihum anna almaa qismatun baynahum kullu shirbin muhtadarun"},{"id":29,"text":"فَنَادَوۡاْ صَاحِبَهُمۡ فَتَعَاطَىٰ فَعَقَرَ","translation_fr":"Puis ils appelèrent leur camarade qui prit [son épée] et [la] tua","translation_en":"But they called their companion, and he dared and hamstrung [her]","transliteration":"Fanadaw sahibahum fataAAata faAAaqara"},{"id":30,"text":"فَكَيۡفَ كَانَ عَذَابِي وَنُذُرِ","translation_fr":"Comment furent donc Mon châtiment et Mes avertissements","translation_en":"And how [severe] were My punishment and warning","transliteration":"Fakayfa kana AAathabee wanuthuri"},{"id":31,"text":"إِنَّآ أَرۡسَلۡنَا عَلَيۡهِمۡ صَيۡحَةٗ وَٰحِدَةٗ فَكَانُواْ كَهَشِيمِ ٱلۡمُحۡتَظِرِ","translation_fr":"Nous lachâmes sur eux un seul Cri, et voilà qu'ils furent réduits à l'état de paille d'étable","translation_en":"Indeed, We sent upon them one blast from the sky, and they became like the dry twig fragments of an [animal] pen","transliteration":"Inna arsalna AAalayhim sayhatan wahidatan fakanoo kahasheemi almuhtathiri"},{"id":32,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ يَسَّرۡنَا ٱلۡقُرۡءَانَ لِلذِّكۡرِ فَهَلۡ مِن مُّدَّكِرٖ","translation_fr":"Et vraiment, Nous avons rendu le Coran facile pour la méditation. Y a-t-il quelqu'un pour réfléchir","translation_en":"And We have certainly made the Qur'an easy for remembrance, so is there any who will remember","transliteration":"Walaqad yassarna alqurana lilththikri fahal min muddakirin"},{"id":33,"text":"كَذَّبَتۡ قَوۡمُ لُوطِۭ بِٱلنُّذُرِ","translation_fr":"Le peuple de Lot traita de mensonges les avertissements","translation_en":"The people of Lot denied the warning","transliteration":"Kaththabat qawmu lootin bialnnuthuri"},{"id":34,"text":"إِنَّآ أَرۡسَلۡنَا عَلَيۡهِمۡ حَاصِبًا إِلَّآ ءَالَ لُوطٖۖ نَّجَّيۡنَٰهُم بِسَحَرٖ","translation_fr":"Nous lachâmes sur eux un ouragan, excepté la famille de Lot que Nous sauvâmes avant l'aube","translation_en":"Indeed, We sent upon them a storm of stones, except the family of Lot - We saved them before dawn","transliteration":"Inna arsalna AAalayhim hasiban illa ala lootin najjaynahum bisaharin"},{"id":35,"text":"نِّعۡمَةٗ مِّنۡ عِندِنَاۚ كَذَٰلِكَ نَجۡزِي مَن شَكَرَ","translation_fr":"à titre de bienfait de Notre part: ainsi récompensons-Nous celui qui est reconnaissant","translation_en":"As favor from us. Thus do We reward he who is grateful","transliteration":"NiAAmatan min AAindina kathalika najzee man shakara"},{"id":36,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ أَنذَرَهُم بَطۡشَتَنَا فَتَمَارَوۡاْ بِٱلنُّذُرِ","translation_fr":"Il les avait pourtant avertis de Nos représailles. Mais ils mirent les avertissements en doute","translation_en":"And he had already warned them of Our assault, but they disputed the warning","transliteration":"Walaqad antharahum batshatana fatamaraw bialnnuthuri"},{"id":37,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ رَٰوَدُوهُ عَن ضَيۡفِهِۦ فَطَمَسۡنَآ أَعۡيُنَهُمۡ فَذُوقُواْ عَذَابِي وَنُذُرِ","translation_fr":"En effet, ils voulaient séduire ses hôtes. Nous aveuglâmes leurs yeux «Goûtez donc Mon châtiment et Mes avertissements»","translation_en":"And they had demanded from him his guests, but We obliterated their eyes, [saying], \"Taste My punishment and warning","transliteration":"Walaqad rawadoohu AAan dayfihi fatamasna aAAyunahum fathooqoo AAathabee wanuthuri"},{"id":38,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ صَبَّحَهُم بُكۡرَةً عَذَابٞ مُّسۡتَقِرّٞ","translation_fr":"En effet, au petit matin, un châtiment persistant les surprit","translation_en":"And there came upon them by morning an abiding punishment","transliteration":"Walaqad sabbahahum bukratan AAathabun mustaqirrun"},{"id":39,"text":"فَذُوقُواْ عَذَابِي وَنُذُرِ","translation_fr":"Goûtez donc Mon châtiment et Mes avertissements","translation_en":"So taste My punishment and warning","transliteration":"Fathooqoo AAathabee wanuthuri"},{"id":40,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ يَسَّرۡنَا ٱلۡقُرۡءَانَ لِلذِّكۡرِ فَهَلۡ مِن مُّدَّكِرٖ","translation_fr":"Et vraiment, Nous avons rendu le Coran facile pour la méditation. Y a-t-il quelqu'un pour réfléchir","translation_en":"And We have certainly made the Qur'an easy for remembrance, so is there any who will remember","transliteration":"Walaqad yassarna alqurana lilththikri fahal min muddakirin"},{"id":41,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ جَآءَ ءَالَ فِرۡعَوۡنَ ٱلنُّذُرُ","translation_fr":"Les avertissements vinrent certes, aux gens de Pharaon","translation_en":"And there certainly came to the people of Pharaoh warning","transliteration":"Walaqad jaa ala firAAawna alnnuthuru"},{"id":42,"text":"كَذَّبُواْ بِـَٔايَٰتِنَا كُلِّهَا فَأَخَذۡنَٰهُمۡ أَخۡذَ عَزِيزٖ مُّقۡتَدِرٍ","translation_fr":"Ils traitèrent de mensonges tous Nos prodiges. Nous les saisîmes donc, de la saisie d'un Puissant Omnipotent","translation_en":"They denied Our signs, all of them, so We seized them with a seizure of one Exalted in Might and Perfect in Ability","transliteration":"Kaththaboo biayatina kulliha faakhathnahum akhtha AAazeezin muqtadirin"},{"id":43,"text":"أَكُفَّارُكُمۡ خَيۡرٞ مِّنۡ أُوْلَـٰٓئِكُمۡ أَمۡ لَكُم بَرَآءَةٞ فِي ٱلزُّبُرِ","translation_fr":"Vos mécréants sont-ils meilleurs que ceux-là? Ou bien y a-t-il dans les Ecritures une immunité pour vous","translation_en":"Are your disbelievers better than those [former ones], or have you immunity in the scripture","transliteration":"Akuffarukum khayrun min olaikum am lakum baraatun fee alzzuburi"},{"id":44,"text":"أَمۡ يَقُولُونَ نَحۡنُ جَمِيعٞ مُّنتَصِرٞ","translation_fr":"Ou bien ils disent: «Nous formons un groupe [fort] et nous vaincrons»","translation_en":"Or do they say, \"We are an assembly supporting [each other]","transliteration":"Am yaqooloona nahnu jameeAAun muntasirun"},{"id":45,"text":"سَيُهۡزَمُ ٱلۡجَمۡعُ وَيُوَلُّونَ ٱلدُّبُرَ","translation_fr":"Leur rassemblement sera bientôt mis en déroute, et ils fuiront","translation_en":"[Their] assembly will be defeated, and they will turn their backs [in retreat]","transliteration":"Sayuhzamu aljamAAu wayuwalloona alddubura"},{"id":46,"text":"بَلِ ٱلسَّاعَةُ مَوۡعِدُهُمۡ وَٱلسَّاعَةُ أَدۡهَىٰ وَأَمَرُّ","translation_fr":"L'Heure, plutôt, sera leur rendez-vous, et l'Heure sera plus terrible et plus amère","translation_en":"But the Hour is their appointment [for due punishment], and the Hour is more disastrous and more bitter","transliteration":"Bali alssaAAatu mawAAiduhum waalssaAAatu adha waamarru"},{"id":47,"text":"إِنَّ ٱلۡمُجۡرِمِينَ فِي ضَلَٰلٖ وَسُعُرٖ","translation_fr":"Les criminels sont certes, dans l'égarement et la folie","translation_en":"Indeed, the criminals are in error and madness","transliteration":"Inna almujrimeena fee dalalin wasuAAurin"},{"id":48,"text":"يَوۡمَ يُسۡحَبُونَ فِي ٱلنَّارِ عَلَىٰ وُجُوهِهِمۡ ذُوقُواْ مَسَّ سَقَرَ","translation_fr":"Le jour où on les traînera dans le Feu sur leurs visages, (on leur dira): «Goûtez au contact de Saqar [la chaleur brûlante de l'Enfer]»","translation_en":"The Day they are dragged into the Fire on their faces [it will be said], \"Taste the touch of Saqar","transliteration":"Yawma yushaboona fee alnnari AAala wujoohihim thooqoo massa saqara"},{"id":49,"text":"إِنَّا كُلَّ شَيۡءٍ خَلَقۡنَٰهُ بِقَدَرٖ","translation_fr":"Nous avons créé toute chose avec mesure","translation_en":"Indeed, all things We created with predestination","transliteration":"Inna kulla shayin khalaqnahu biqadarin"},{"id":50,"text":"وَمَآ أَمۡرُنَآ إِلَّا وَٰحِدَةٞ كَلَمۡحِۭ بِٱلۡبَصَرِ","translation_fr":"et Notre ordre est une seule [parole]; [il est prompt] comme un clin d'œil","translation_en":"And Our command is but one, like a glance of the eye","transliteration":"Wama amruna illa wahidatun kalamhin bialbasari"},{"id":51,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ أَهۡلَكۡنَآ أَشۡيَاعَكُمۡ فَهَلۡ مِن مُّدَّكِرٖ","translation_fr":"En effet, nous avons fait périr des peuples semblables à vous. Y a-t-il quelqu'un pour s'en souvenir","translation_en":"And We have already destroyed your kinds, so is there any who will remember","transliteration":"Walaqad ahlakna ashyaAAakum fahal min muddakirin"},{"id":52,"text":"وَكُلُّ شَيۡءٖ فَعَلُوهُ فِي ٱلزُّبُرِ","translation_fr":"Et tout ce qu'ils ont fait est mentionné dans les registres","translation_en":"And everything they did is in written records","transliteration":"Wakullu shayin faAAaloohu fee alzzuburi"},{"id":53,"text":"وَكُلُّ صَغِيرٖ وَكَبِيرٖ مُّسۡتَطَرٌ","translation_fr":"et tout fait, petit et grand, est consigné","translation_en":"And every small and great [thing] is inscribed","transliteration":"Wakullu sagheerin wakabeerin mustatarun"},{"id":54,"text":"إِنَّ ٱلۡمُتَّقِينَ فِي جَنَّـٰتٖ وَنَهَرٖ","translation_fr":"Les pieux seront dans des Jardins et parmi des ruisseaux","translation_en":"Indeed, the righteous will be among gardens and rivers","transliteration":"Inna almuttaqeena fee jannatin wanaharin"},{"id":55,"text":"فِي مَقۡعَدِ صِدۡقٍ عِندَ مَلِيكٖ مُّقۡتَدِرِۭ","translation_fr":"dans un séjour de vérité, auprès d'un Souverain Omnipotent","translation_en":"In a seat of honor near a Sovereign, Perfect in Ability","transliteration":"Fee maqAAadi sidqin AAinda maleekin muqtadirin"}]}